{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0154_1000_p", "source_sha256": "81131cf4d45ae665abfbf49b097c6688a62156d096c071f873807c20862667b4", "ja": "（春香と可憐のライブは大成功！\n静まらない歓声を背に、春香が戻ってきた）", "zh": "（春香和可怜的演唱会大获成功！\n伴随着久久不息的欢呼声，春香回来了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0154_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "3d5f95eb78ed3a1bc898b7ce5dd8d84cda5d801c484e41a481bb5453b434955c", "ja": "ふう……。", "zh": "呼……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0154_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3bf3f231de8df50a3dd9746990e293483fb676f58fd52c3d2aaaaf57f2aa6eca", "ja": "春香、お疲れさま！\n本当によく頑張ったな！", "zh": "春香，辛苦了！\n真的非常努力呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0154_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "527002ff96b20011af7f7b56d8419ef9a985709d66956064fecc57f9059ea39b", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nはいっ、ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n好的，谢谢您♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0154_1004_p", "source_sha256": "75fba50a0d943e508d0dce035609a52b0737365fe667a372dd604e7dcd94543a", "ja": "今回のライブ、ふたりに出演してもらって正解……\nあれ？　可憐はどこに行ったんだ？", "zh": "这次的演唱会，让你们两个人参加果然没错……\n咦？可怜去哪儿了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0154_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "9b0ac317de04d4422c0e5e6405859bc7c1756b027c91e5850f4da11daffaa42c", "ja": "あ、可憐ちゃんは……ライブが終わってすぐに、\n茜ちゃんたちに連れて行かれちゃいました。", "zh": "啊，可怜她……演出一结束，就被小茜他们带走了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0154_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "c78edace6e158b4ab540dbbae9ed9057eab2c3def91993bbaacb06374214033d", "ja": "もう打ち上げの準備をしてくれたそうです！\nお花見弁当のお返しにって。ふふっ♪", "zh": "说是已经准备好庆功会了哦！\n说是作为赏花便当的回礼。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0154_1007_p", "source_sha256": "89d0db60ffbe8163b13fa0b877150ece2f834899b30f19f6bea0a782d5e17e29", "ja": "ああ、ライブの前に花見をしたんだっけ？\nリコッタとりるきゃんのメンバーで。", "zh": "啊，我们是在演唱会前一起赏花来着吧？\n是和Ricotta以及Rilukyan的成员一起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0154_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "5c577ee1ac1b6c35d3e1ff0b3457a27e9c5cbce62acc2080a0b7b3e8a52c5616", "ja": "はい！　今日はあの時のメンバーが、\nみんな来てくれて、応援もしてくれて……。", "zh": "是的！今天那时的成员们都来了，还为我们加油……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0154_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "06f2a2f8b8195c961acb602517665e978203ab2b68a90bb8586278aac9bbd7c5", "ja": "ライブ終わってすぐ、よかったよーって\n言いに来てくれました♪", "zh": "演出结束后，大家马上就过来跟我说“很棒哦——”♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0154_1010_p", "source_sha256": "98b5c838c4dacd5a774e8b28f69997e2efea3808fd7d2fd4fbd60a8615b63282", "ja": "みんな、春香たちのライブを楽しみにしてたんだな。\n期待に応えられて良かったじゃないか。", "zh": "大家一直都很期待春香你们的演出啊。\n能回应大家的期待，这不是挺好的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0154_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "6c3ed8a99667faf1518261e34f8955bf0e42ce7fd405cdb32536f64f199dd9dd", "ja": "そうですね！　もちろん、お客さんに喜んでもらうのが\n一番大事ですけど……。", "zh": "是啊！当然，让观众们开心是最重要的，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0154_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "a0a8f2259af7b703794a741997d1e0953745aa2c83b47f8d533402fce9de2afb", "ja": "でも、劇場のみんなに喜んでもらえるのも、\nとってもうれしいです♪", "zh": "不过，能让剧场里的大家感到开心，我也特别高兴♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0154_1013_p", "source_sha256": "40043c4e8f797bbe4cff6981d97cc9de7a5842d61c5b0a3934ce28b4df2f17f7", "ja": "……あれ？　そういえば、春香は打ち上げに\n行かなくてよかったのか？", "zh": "……咦？说起来，春香不去参加庆功宴\n没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0154_1014_001har", "source_sha256": "b622d22216206746f46dcae105a296af8aaf324b791dfa553ccbce50246798ee", "ja": "ふふっ、私は{$P$}さんを\n連れていく係ですよ♪", "zh": "呵呵，我可是负责带着{$P$}先生一起去的哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0154_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "550b5c5eec357c63ac83264b86cafe6ca9789c3ceedeca8d57ca3e578395a4e6", "ja": "それに、その……{$P$}さんの\n感想も、最初に聞いておきたかったですし。", "zh": "而且，那个……我也想第一个听到您对{$P$}先生的感想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0154_1016_p", "source_sha256": "974c700190392f925eb0cce553d435485b245b4431d8ea08c7935a739864b409", "ja": "感想って、ライブの感想を？　それは、\nお客さんの大歓声で、もう答えが出てるんじゃ……。", "zh": "你说的感想，是指对演唱会的感想吗？那不是已经从客人们的热烈欢呼声中得到答案了吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0154_1017_001har", "source_sha256": "4a832a187f0684f15d5a528a521443b7a7311deebeae60214f5a515328d06e14", "ja": "そ、そうかもしれませんけど……\n{$P$}さんから聞きたいんですっ。", "zh": "也、也许是这样没错……  \n可是，我想听{$P$}先生亲口说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0154_1018_001har", "source_sha256": "b205e14808f7f37af0376a64251325c7b426ac140ab5d1c90397f4f46822e0c4", "ja": "ほら、お弁当を作ったら「おいしかった？」って、\n聞きたくなっちゃうじゃないですか。それと同じで！", "zh": "你看，做好便当后，都会忍不住想问一句“好吃吗？”，对吧？这也是一样的嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0154_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "7638d5bc03119e46aea83419825e678253790f60a78f1f63399ac0c8a40b36b5", "ja": "なんでもない、いつもの言葉でも……。やっぱり、\n{$P$}さんから聞きたいなって……。", "zh": "即使是没什么特别的、平时常说的话……果然还是想从{$P$}先生那里听到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0154_1020_p", "source_sha256": "3d666a98ffc2e81ab19094c27d30c02be0f92956299dca7d7aa31f26e1504e37", "ja": "なるほど。そういう事なら……", "zh": "原来如此。既然是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0154_1021", "source_sha256": "98ab9ba4e7e9104f3fc7ad91e7dd517b51542afeb14daa9e857493b97956b976", "ja": "改めて言葉にする", "zh": "重新用语言表达出来", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0154_2000_p", "source_sha256": "f9e0654e5718357dcae69494d2ca90817ddc030558a22ff8cfc64808e2e52dd3", "ja": "今日のステージ、とっても良かったよ。その衣装と\n合わせて、春香は最高に輝いてた。よく頑張ったな！", "zh": "今天的舞台表现特别棒。配上那身服装，春香简直闪耀到了极点。你真的很努力，做得好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0154_2001_001har", "source_sha256": "20440b691a93a202b8e147cc0e5b51cf3bb1fe118076f4b9a43b5fbca5a06c92", "ja": "わあっ……。\nえへへっ、はい！　ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "哇啊……\n嘿嘿，嗯！非常感谢您♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0154_2002_001har", "source_sha256": "1f73b8688120438a786a94b330e6a13434871e04657973a9ed0dd322b18cf4f7", "ja": "{$P$}さん。私、これからも、\nまた同じことを聞いちゃうかもですけど……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生。我今后可能也还是会\n向您问起同样的事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0154_2003_001har", "source_sha256": "6e2b35d473586d7508eae6d357abddd898e75e2037e3ba3dc29d763547654d5d", "ja": "その時は、また{$P$}さんの言葉、\n聞かせてくださいね♪", "zh": "到那时，也请再让我听听{$P$}先生的话哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
